{'symbol': 'AMD', 'date': '2021-11-18 16:00:00', 'title': 'AMD AND MEDIATEK DEVELOP AMD RZ600 SERIES WI-FI 6E MODULES TO ENHANCE LAPTOP AND DESKTOP PC CONNECTIVITY EXPERIENCES', 'text': "LAGUNA BEACH, CALIF., NOV.\xa018, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MEDIATEK (TWSE: 2454) AND AMD (NASDAQ: AMD) TODAY ANNOUNCED A COLLABORATION TO CO-ENGINEER INDUSTRY LEADING WI-FI® SOLUTIONS, STARTING WITH THE AMD RZ600 SERIES WI-FI 6E MODULES CONTAINING MEDIATEK'S NEW FILOGIC 330P CHIPSET."}